    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/793350/extras/477bf6a2ad0aa2954049930745e87d15.poster.avif?t=1695751879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/793350/extras/477bf6a2ad0aa2954049930745e87d15.webm?t=1695751879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/793350/extras/477bf6a2ad0aa2954049930745e87d15.mp4?t=1695751879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Swarmlake is an ultra-intense first-person shooter ballet about fighting a record-breaking swarm.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Powerful</strong>: Fight a record-breaking swarm with an overpowered weapon<br></li><li><strong>Vertical</strong>: Soar through the sky by repeatedly jumping off of enemies<br></li><li><strong>Intense</strong>: Countless enemies at once thanks to the own game engine<br></li><li><strong>Smooth</strong>: Deterministic gameplay based on years of feedback<br></li><li><strong>Fun</strong>: Fast-paced and addictive highscore-chase with online replays</li></ul>",
